    Same parchment tile and ink droplet as the adaptive version, but drawn to fill the
    canvas instead of leaving the 18dp adaptive bleed, since nothing masks this one.
    API 26+ uses mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml instead.
-->
